data/unidades.json
data/correcoes.json
data/portugal.geojson
data/grelha_*.json
data/modelo_tempo_*.json

    Derived from OpenStreetMap.
    © OpenStreetMap contributors, https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
    Licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0:
    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

    These are Derivative Databases under the ODbL. You may copy, distribute and
    adapt them, provided you attribute OpenStreetMap and release any derived
    database under the same licence.

data/populacao_pt.csv
data/grelha_*.json (the population figures inside them)

    Derived from Eurostat, Census 2021 population grid.
    © European Union, 2026.
    Source: https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/gisco/geodata/population-distribution/population-grids

    The data has been MODIFIED by this project: filtered to Portugal,
    reprojected from ETRS89-LAEA (EPSG:3035) to WGS84, and aggregated onto a
    coarser grid. Reuse is permitted provided the source is acknowledged and
    the modification is declared. See the "População" section of the README.

Travel times are computed with OSRM (https://project-osrm.org/) over the
OpenStreetMap road network, and are estimates without traffic. Base map tiles
are © OpenStreetMap contributors.
